<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Rolls-Royce upped at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Rolls-Royce upped at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeroengine maker Rolls-Royce Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers noted the change of stance had come after a period of underperformance by Rolls shares and that Rolls was relatively insulated from problems of sterling strength -- a recent problem for others in the sector -- because its exposure is to the even stronger dollar.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
